# LIBRARY: own
# Functions that call one another are a loop: the number that they pass round is stepped as an integer, as long as a comparison finds it far from 2 ** 53. There it is stepped as a double.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: code f1:Body
# CHECK: TypeTest {{*}} testedType=int[1, 2147483648]
# CHECK: Sub {{*}} form=Integers
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ANSWERS: 0 3 -9007199254740992 9007199254740989 -2147483651
# ANSWERS-NEXT: exited with 0
